<title>FINLAND: KASOLA 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 1.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>KASOLA 4-MTH PROFIT UP TO FIM 1.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Four months to end-April,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before appropriations, tax	    1.4 vs 0.8</p>
<p> Profit before extraordinary items, tax     1.6 vs 0.8</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   0.42 vs 0.26</p>
<p> Net sales					   35.5 vs 36.1</p>
<p> Operating profit				   2.2 vs 2.3</p>
<p> Net profit					   0.9 vs 0.9</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    42.5 vs N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish safe and safety device maker is</p>
<p>Kasola Oy.  --Hki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
